<dialog id="newsletter-dialog" class="newsletter-dialog bg-body text-body rounded" aria-labelledby="newsletterTitle" aria-describedby="newsletterHelp"><div class="newsletter-card p-3 p-sm-4"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-3 mb-3"><div><p class="text-danger fw-bold small mb-1">67FILMS ЖАҢАЛЫҚТАРЫ</p><h2 class="h4 mb-0" id="newsletterTitle">Кино жаңалықтарына жазылу</h2></div><button class="btn-close flex-shrink-0" type="button" data-newsletter-close aria-label="Жазылым терезесін жабу"></button></div><p class="small text-body-secondary" id="newsletterHelp">Сүйікті жанрыңызды таңдаңыз. Бұл оқу демосы: нақты email хаттары жіберілмейді.</p><form id="newsletter-form" data-js-validation><div class="alert alert-danger" data-error-summary role="alert" hidden></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="newsletterName">Атыңыз</label><input class="form-control" id="newsletterName" name="newsletterName" type="text" autocomplete="name" minlength="2" maxlength="80" autofocus required data-validate-field aria-describedby="newsletterName-error"><div class="invalid-feedback d-block" id="newsletterName-error" hidden></div></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="newsletterEmail">Email</label><input class="form-control" id="newsletterEmail" name="newsletterEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="120" required data-validate-field aria-describedby="newsletterEmail-error"><div class="invalid-feedback d-block" id="newsletterEmail-error" hidden></div></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="newsletterGenre">Қай жанр қызықтырады?</label><select class="form-select" id="newsletterGenre" name="genre"><option>Барлық жанр</option><option>Фантастика</option><option>Комедия</option><option>Аниме</option><option>Дорама</option></select></div><div class="form-check mb-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="newsletterConsent" name="newsletterConsent" required data-validate-field aria-describedby="newsletterConsent-error"><label class="form-check-label" for="newsletterConsent">Бұл жазылым оқу демосы екенін түсінемін.</label><div class="invalid-feedback d-block" id="newsletterConsent-error" hidden></div></div><button class="btn btn-danger w-100" type="submit">Жазылымды тексеру</button><p class="form-success mt-3 mb-0" data-form-status role="status"></p></form></div></dialog>